  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>On&nbsp; treating sulphite (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>) with warm dilute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;gas is evolved which is suffocating with the smell of burning sulphur.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>The gas turns potassium dichromate paper acidified with dil. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>, green.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p>"
  }
